PetBasis_Story_10140�
PetBasis_Story_10140�炽焰幼虎，出生于炽热的火山口，被火焰和岩浆孕育而生。从幼年起，它的爪子便带有炽热的火焰，随着每一次跳跃和撕裂，空气都会被其利爪灼烧。虽然体型尚小，但它的爆发力却不容小觑。�Inthedepthsofthevastforest,WalkingGrassisanancientandmysteriousplantcreature.Itsbodyappearsdelicate,butitcontainstheinfinitepowerofnature.WalkingGrasslikestoroamquietlyontheearth,sometimesstoppingtoscatterparasiticseedsinthesoil.
�
PetBasis_Story_10141�
PetBasis_Story_10141�随着时间的推移，炽焰幼虎成长为强大的炽焰虎。它的力量宛如雷霆般不可抵挡，每一次攻击都如猛兽般迅猛而精准。炽焰虎的爪击已变得极为强大，撕裂敌人的同时带来炽热的灼烧效果。�Astimepassed,WalkingGrassevolvedintoamorepowerfulform—WalkingBeast.ThisformofWalkingBeasthasathickerbodyandstrongerpower,anditscontrolovertheearthisdeeper.WalkingBeast'smovementsaremoresteady,everystepseemstoawakenthesleepinggrassandsoil.
�
PetBasis_Story_10150�
PetBasis_Story_10150�惊吓魔盒喜欢藏在角落，等敌人靠近时突然打开它的神秘魔盒，伴随着巨大的“砰”声，把敌人吓得魂飞魄散。每次魔盒爆裂后，它都会得意地说：“惊不惊喜？意不意外？xLegendhasitthatIceHornDeeroncehelpedalosttravelerfindhiswayhome,andsincethenithasbeenregardedasasymbolofkindnessandhope.
