PetBasis_Story_10151�
PetBasis_Story_10151�进化后的小丑魔盒对“惊吓”已经不满足了，它追求的是轰轰烈烈的场面！每次释放魔盒，小丑魔盒都会站在远处狂笑：“震撼吧，震撼吧！”爆炸波席卷整个战场，敌人都被震得怀疑人生，它却开心地喊着：“看，我可是爆炸艺术家！”�AlthoughFrostHornDeerlooksmighty,itisactuallyverysilly.Legendhasitthattheyonceburiedthemselvesinasnowdriftwhileplaying,andwerenotfounduntilthenextday.
�
PetBasis_Story_10160�
PetBasis_Story_10160�尖叫鸡本来是个不起眼的小鸡，直到它发现自己发出的尖叫声能让敌人耳朵怀疑人生。每次战斗，尖叫鸡都会发出那令人胆寒的尖锐音波，敌人听了不是抱头大叫，就是四处乱窜。惨叫鸡得意地说：“我这一嗓子，连我自己都吓！”�LowerNinjaMushroomhasjuststartedonthepathoftheninja,itsskillistosecretlyplantmushrooms,buteverytimeitreleasespoisonousmushrooms,theenemiesjustpinchtheirnosesandrunaway.Althoughthepoisoneffectisnotobvious,LowerNinjaMushroomfirmlybelieves:"Eventhesmelliestmushroomcanwin!"
�
PetBasis_Story_10161�
PetBasis_Story_10161�惨叫鸡进化成了勇士鸡，告别了尖叫，拿起了一把长枪！它现在的绝招是“鸡式闪电突刺”，挥舞着长枪以闪电般的速度冲向敌人�Aftermanyfailures,LowerNinjaMushroomevolvedintoUpperNinjaMushroom.Nowitorganizes"MushroomParties",releasinglargeareasofpoisonousmushroomstocoverthebattlefield.Enemiesfleeinalldirectionsatthesmellofmushrooms,whileUpperNinjaMushroomproudlydirectsthepoisongascarnival.
�
PetBasis_Story_10170�
PetBasis_Story_10170�鼹鼠幼崽是个小小的冒险家，它总喜欢瞬间消失在地面上，再从地底突然出现，给敌人来个意想不到的“地底惊喜”。每次出击，它都会带来强烈的冲击波，让周围的敌人措手不及。一次，它在追逐闪电虫时意外发现了“地下突袭”的诀窍，成为了战场上的捉迷藏高手。�UpperNinjaMushroomeventuallyevolvedintoShadowNinjaMushroom,abandoningpoisonousmushroomsandrelyingontheultimateskill"GodspeedSlash"tosolveproblems.Itdashesatextremespeed,andbeforetheenemycanreact,ithasalreadysilently"slicedthemintomushroompieces".
