PetBasis_Story_10562�核弹鲨是毁灭的象征，每次它召唤出数枚威力无穷的核弹，爆炸的冲击波便碾碎周围的一切。敌人在核弹爆炸的恐怖冲击下瞬间被摧毁，整个战场仿佛遭遇了一场小型末日。核弹鲨的存在，意味着一切障碍都将化为灰烬。�TheSoundwaveCrocodile'ssecretweaponisactuallyamicrophone!Itusesthemicrophonetoemit震撼的声波,andeverytimeitroars,thesoundwavescutthroughenemydefenseslikeblades.Itwavesthemicrophonearound,saying,"Withthismicrophoneinhand,whodaresignoremyvoice?"Eachtime,enemiesareleftdisorientedand狼狈不堪.
