PetBasis_Story_10570�
PetBasis_Story_10570�茶杯灵看起来像个普通的小茶杯，但可别被它的外表骗了！每当它激发体内的火元素，火焰就会瞬间迸发，把敌人烧得焦头烂额。谁能想到，喝茶的小杯子竟然能变成一枚火焰“炸弹”？小茶杯的热情可不是一般的烫！�Afterevolving,theSpeakerCrocodilebecomesatruerockstar.Itsmicrophonenotonlyamplifiessoundbutalsocreatessoundwaveechoes,throwingenemiesintochaos.WhenevertheSpeakerCrocodileraisesitsmicrophoneandunleashesamassivesoundwaveattack,itproudlydeclares,"Getreadyformy'earth-shaking'performance!"Theenemiesareleftdazed,anditadds,"Musiccanheal,butitcanalsodestroy!"
