PetBasis_Story_10571�进化后的象茶壶，体内的火元素比以前更强大，火焰如熔岩般喷涌而出，瞬间焚尽一切。它就像一个行走的熔岩喷发口，无论挡在它面前的是谁，都逃不过被烤焦的命运。�TheFireSpiritPigismostproudofitsburningtail.Everytimeitflicksitstail,scorchingflamesinstantlyignitethesurroundingenemies.Italwaysboasts,"Mytailisn'tjustforshow—it'salittletorch!"Wheneveritseesenemiesjumpingfromtheburns,itlaughshappily,"Hehe,it'sbarbecuetime!"
