PetBasis_Story_10580�
PetBasis_Story_10580�蜜汁蜗牛虽然行动缓慢，但它的攻击方式可是让敌人头疼。它召唤出蜜汁蜂箱，瞬间蜂群四散而出，敌人们还没反应过来，就被密密麻麻的小蜂团团围住。别小看这只慢吞吞的蜗牛，它的蜂群可是“致命蜂暴”！�Afterevolving,theBlazingPigbecomesevenmoreferocious.Theflamesonitsheadarenolongerjustforignition—itcannow喷发出炽热的火流,incineratingallenemiesinitspath.Aftereachattack,theBlazingPigproudlydeclares,"Iamthekingofflames!Whocanwithstandthisinferno?"Watchingenemiesburnwithnoescape,itsmilescontentedly,"Burningeverythingcleanisthehighestart."
