PetBasis_Story_10581�
PetBasis_Story_10581�进化后的堡垒蜗牛，不仅壳子更坚固，它的蜜汁蜂箱也更加强大。大量的蜂群如同黑云般涌出，疯狂袭击敌人。无论敌人跑得多快，蜂群总能紧紧跟上，形成一场令人无从躲避的蜂群狂潮，堡垒蜗牛静静地“观战”，显得有些悠闲。�Don'tlettheSteelClawCub'ssmallsizefoolyou—it'snoordinarylittledragon.Onceitactivatesitslaserbeam,enemiesaretargetedlikebya"lasereye,"withnotimetorun.It'slikeaministeelcannon,andwhenitfiresitslaser,adazzlingbeamflashes,instantlyknockingenemiesoffbalanceandleavingthemscrambling.
