PetBasis_Story_10582�
PetBasis_Story_10582�到了城堡蜗牛的阶段，它的蜜汁蜂箱召唤出了终极蜂群。蜂群如同一片遮天蔽日的黑幕，蜂群的攻击简直如同爆炸般摧毁一切。这场“蜂群风暴”席卷全场，敌人无处可逃，整个战场被覆盖在疯狂的蜜汁蜂群之中，仿佛一切都逃不过它的掌控。�Afterevolving,theSteelArmorTyrantnotonlygrowsinsizebutalsoupgradesitslaserintoadevastatingweapon.Everytimeitfiresitspowerfullaser,it'slikebowling—enemiesareknockeddownonebyoneinaline.Theresult?Gone!Theairistornapartbyitslaser,andenemiesarehistorybeforetheyevenrealizewhathitthem.
